<%# The browser-tab icon: the hex nut on its own, so the H still reads at 16 px (public/favicon.svg, which turns
    white on a dark tab bar, and favicon.ico for anything that asks for one). Phones' home screens get the square
    app icon. The ?v= is bumped when the drawing changes, because browsers hold on to tab icons for a long time. %>
<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico?v=3" sizes="48x48">
<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg?v=3" type="image/svg+xml">
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/icon.png?v=3">
